# shutdown(1)

## NAME

shutdown - turn the computer off

## SYNOPSIS

    shutdown [-h|-r] [now]

## DESCRIPTION

Turns the computer off, or restarts it with `-r`. Only `now` is accepted as the time. It does not return when accepted.

## OPTIONS

- `-h`: turn off (the default)
- `-r`: restart, like `reboot`

## SEE ALSO

reboot(1)
